                <pb facs="0281" n="185" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg185"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.00/588: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">McMillin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-16T17:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:30
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>54. Minister of Foreign Affairs and First and Second Designados and certain other
                    prisoners released. Escamilla only member of Cabinet held in prison. Situation
                    improving.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McMillin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
